@Hussar of The East (testing testing)

Okay good. I hope you all can see this ping. If you can't well that's an issue. If you can, congrats! You're part of the demographic audience for this ping.

Simply because, and I regret to inform you, this role is intended and shall now be used for, notifying all necessary folks about votes we have going on in our WAA. Your participation is really necessary to make sure that I, as Delegate, am voting in the WA the way the region wants me to.  You guys are the voices that I am speaking for when it comes to WA votes. Starting from hereonin, this channel will utilize the Hussar ping. If you don't want it to ping you, I believe if you fully mute this channel it will only show a ping but not actually notify you (I have many channels that do that myself).
